#: ../../source/users/schema/paste.rst:5
msgid "Paste object"
msgstr "粘贴对象"

#: ../../source/users/schema/paste.rst:7
msgid ""
"QElectroTech allows pasting objects (`element`_, `conductor`_, `text "
"field`_, `basic object`_ and `picture`_) which has already been `copied`_ or"
" `cut`_ at the same `folio`_ or at different `folio`_ and/or `project`_."
msgstr ""
"QElectroTech允许粘贴对象(`元件 <element_>`_，`导体 <conductor_>`_，`文本字段 <text "
"field_>`_，`基本对象 <basic object_>`_ 和 `图片 <picture_>`_) 已经 `复制 <copied_>`_ 或 "
"`剪切 <cut_>`_ 同为 `图幅 <folio_>`_ 或不同地点 `图幅 <folio_>`_ 和(或) `项目 <project_>`_。"

#: ../../source/users/schema/paste.rst:13
msgid ""
"Multiples objects can be pasted at the same time `copying`_ or `cutting`_ "
"multiple objects."
msgstr "多个对象可以同时粘贴 `复制 <copying_>`_ 或 `剪切 <cutting_>`_ 多个对象。"

#: ../../source/users/schema/paste.rst:17
msgid ""
"The `element`_ would suffer data losses if the intention is to paste it at "
"different `project`_."
msgstr "如果打算用不同的 `元件 <element_>`_ 粘贴数据，则 `项目 <project_>`_ 将遭受数据损失。"

#: ../../source/users/schema/paste.rst:19
msgid ""
"Pasting objects can be done from `menu bar`_, `toolbar`_, by right click at "
"the `workspace`_ and using the corresponding keyboard shortcut."
msgstr ""
"粘贴对象可以从 `菜单栏 <menu bar_>`_，`工具栏 <toolbar_>`_ 中通过右键点击 `工作区 <workspace_>`_ "
"并使用相应的键盘快捷键完成。"

#: ../../source/users/schema/paste.rst:23
msgid "Paste object from menu bar"
msgstr "从菜单栏粘贴对象"

#: ../../source/users/schema/paste.rst:25
msgid ""
"Select **Edit > Paste** menu item to paste at the active `folio`_ an object "
"`copied`_ or `cut`_ previously."
msgstr ""
"选择 **编辑 > 粘贴** 菜单项在活动 `图幅 <folio_>`_ 上粘贴对象 `复制 <copied_>`_ 或 `剪切 <cut_>`_ 。"

#: ../../source/users/schema/paste.rst:30
msgid "Figure: QElectroTech edit menu"
msgstr "图：QElectroTech 编辑菜单"

#: ../../source/users/schema/paste.rst:33
msgid "Paste object from toolbar"
msgstr "从工具栏粘贴对象"

#: ../../source/users/schema/paste.rst:35
msgid ""
"Select the icon |edit-paste| from `toolbar`_ to paste at the active `folio`_"
" an object `copied`_ or `cut`_ previously."
msgstr ""
"从 `工具栏 <toolbar_>`_ 选择图标 |edit-paste| 在活动 `图幅 <folio_>`_ 上粘贴一个对象 `复制 "
"<copied_>`_ 或 `剪切 <cut_>`_ 。"

#: ../../source/users/schema/paste.rst:37
msgid "edit-paste"
msgstr "编辑-粘贴"

#: ../../source/users/schema/paste.rst:41
msgid ""
"If the `toolbar`_ is not displayed, it can be displayed from **Settings > "
"Display > Tools**."
msgstr "如果 `工具栏 <toolbar_>`_ 未显示，可以从 **设置 > 显示 > 工具** 显示。"

#: ../../source/users/schema/paste.rst:44
msgid "Paste object by right click"
msgstr "右键粘贴对象"

#: ../../source/users/schema/paste.rst:46
msgid ""
"Right click at the `workspace`_ area where the object should be pasted."
msgstr "在 `工作区 <workspace_>`_ 区域右键单击，该物体应当粘贴。"

#: ../../source/users/schema/paste.rst:47
msgid ""
"Select the option **Paste Here** to paste an object `copied`_ or `cut`_ "
"previously."
msgstr "选择选项 **Paste Here** 粘贴一个对象 `复制 <copied_>`_ 或 `剪切 <cut_>`_ 。"

#: ../../source/users/schema/paste.rst:52
msgid "Figure: QElectroTech right click PopUP window"
msgstr "图：右键点击 PopUP 窗口的QElectroTech"

#: ../../source/users/schema/paste.rst:55
msgid "Paste object using keyboard shortcut"
msgstr "使用键盘快捷键粘贴对象"

#: ../../source/users/schema/paste.rst:57
msgid ""
"QElectroTech allows using keyboard shortcut to increase the working "
"efficiency."
msgstr "QElectroTech允许使用键盘快捷键来提高工作效率。"

#: ../../source/users/schema/paste.rst:59
msgid ""
"Press ``Ctrl + v`` to paste at the active `folio`_ an object `copied`_ or "
"`cut`_ previously."
msgstr ""
"按 ``Ctrl + v`` 在活动 `图幅 <folio_>`_ 粘贴一个对象 `复制 <copied_>`_ 或 `剪切 <cut_>`_ 。"

#: ../../source/users/schema/paste.rst:63
msgid ""
"For more information about QElectroTech keyboard shortcuts, refer to `menu "
"bar`_ section."
msgstr "关于QElectroTech键盘快捷键的更多信息，请参见 `菜单栏 <menu bar_>`_ 一节。"
